            "description": "Creates a root comment (or reply when `parentId` is set).\n\nRun `GET /captcha` first so Postman has the `captcha` cookie and `{{captcha_answer}}`.\n\nAllowed HTML tags: `<a href=\"...\" title=\"...\">`, `<code>`, `<i>`, `<strong>` (strictly well-formed XHTML)."
          },
